{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01T9m9JzH7AD55kG9bqLxzjN","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on the context filesystem, I found the answer to your question:\\\\n\\\\n## Answer\\\\n\\\\nIn the cluster mirroring design (KIP-1279), **the destination-created mirror topic uses the destination cluster's default replication factor, NOT the source topic's replication factor**.\\\\n\\\\nThis was explicitly documented as a key design decision in the KIP-1279 discussion:\\\\n\\\\n**AS25 (replication factor inheritance): \\\\\\\"Decided against inheriting source replication factor; use destination cluster default\\\\\\\"**\\\\n\\\\nThis design decision was made by Federico Valeri in response to Andrew Schofield's review comments and is cited in the Window 96 discussion dated 2026-04-15T08:31:19Z.\\\\n\\\\n**Source:** `/store/discussions.md` (lines 1121-1134), Window 96, section \\\\\\\"[DISCUSS] KIP-1279: Cluster Mirroring — Continued Deep Technical Review\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"store\\\",\\\"index.md\\\",\\\"discussions.md\\\",\\\"components.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":29.83,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":3,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":334704,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":37839,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.12054640000000001,\\\"input_tokens\\\":98,\\\"output_tokens\\\":2260}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ae5abe8a-ecbd-4aa4-9b67-610e293867be","uuid":"41a347be-33e9-4598-9236-c399cee09022","timestamp":"2026-09-27T19:03:38.405Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on the context filesystem, I found the answer to your question:\\\\n\\\\n## Answer\\\\n\\\\nIn the cluster mirroring design (KIP-1279), **the destination-created mirror topic uses the destination cluster's default replication factor, NOT the source topic's replication factor**.\\\\n\\\\nThis was explicitly documented as a key design decision in the KIP-1279 discussion:\\\\n\\\\n**AS25 (replication factor inheritance): \\\\\\\"Decided against inheriting source replication factor; use destination cluster default\\\\\\\"**\\\\n\\\\nThis design decision was made by Federico Valeri in response to Andrew Schofield's review comments and is cited in the Window 96 discussion dated 2026-04-15T08:31:19Z.\\\\n\\\\n**Source:** `/store/discussions.md` (lines 1121-1134), Window 96, section \\\\\\\"[DISCUSS] KIP-1279: Cluster Mirroring — Continued Deep Technical Review\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"store\\\",\\\"index.md\\\",\\\"discussions.md\\\",\\\"components.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":29.83,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":3,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":334704,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":37839,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.12054640000000001,\\\"input_tokens\\\":98,\\\"output_tokens\\\":2260}}\"}","_meta":{"fastmcp":{"wrap_result":true}},"structuredContent":{"result":"{\"answer\":\"Based on the context filesystem, I found the answer to your question:\\n\\n## Answer\\n\\nIn the cluster mirroring design (KIP-1279), **the destination-created mirror topic uses the destination cluster's default replication factor, NOT the source topic's replication factor**.\\n\\nThis was explicitly documented as a key design decision in the KIP-1279 discussion:\\n\\n**AS25 (replication factor inheritance): \\\"Decided against inheriting source replication factor; use destination cluster default\\\"**\\n\\nThis design decision was made by Federico Valeri in response to Andrew Schofield's review comments and is cited in the Window 96 discussion dated 2026-04-15T08:31:19Z.\\n\\n**Source:** `/store/discussions.md` (lines 1121-1134), Window 96, section \\\"[DISCUSS] KIP-1279: Cluster Mirroring — Continued Deep Technical Review\\\"\",\"error\":null,\"files\":[\"store\",\"index.md\",\"discussions.md\",\"components.md\"],\"seconds\":29.83,\"truncated\":false,\"turns\":3,\"usage\":{\"cache_read_tokens\":334704,\"cache_write_tokens\":37839,\"cost_